'''Maji Cat & Cat Tour Group''' is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Maji Island Tour Collaboration Event]]. They were added in [[Version 8.4 Update|Version 8.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Maji Cat & Cat Tour Group
|image = E 451.png
|appearance = [[Maji Island Tour Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 360元 - 1,422元
}}

==Enemy==
A pathetic enemy with extremely low health, damage and range. This enemy serves no threat to any player that comes across it.

==Strategy==
Use anything to defeat it as it will most likely die in one hit anyway.

